The data files in code_submission_polished/read_data/ are derived from the
Japanese Mortality Database (National Institute of Population and Social
Security Research, https://www.ipss.go.jp/p-toukei/JMD/index-en.html) and are
subject to that database's terms of use rather than the MIT License above.
